<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81359" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιηγ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lying in a circle</i>, of
			the Cyclades lying round Delos, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				198
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωμῆται π</span>. <i>round
				about, neighbouring</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				66b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the arms,
				<i>tied behind one,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				APl.
				4.195
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Satyr.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>circular</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίκοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Anat.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					59
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτή, ἁψῖδες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.559
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.138
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.P.
					157
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῶναι</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Eratosth.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				16.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>surrounding</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονίῃ π. γαίων</span>
			<i>circumambient</i> solitude, <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>revolving</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">᾽Ελίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					2.105
				</span></i>
			.</div>
